  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Thank you very much for your continued efforts in the development and operation of the service.\n\nAt present, it is not possible to retrieve the open/close state of the ActionMenu from Udon. However, if this were made possible, I believe it would be very useful in a variety of use cases.\n\nFor example:\n\nIn VR, I created a Udon system operated with the right stick, but it continues to function even while the ActionMenu is open. I would like to suppress this behavior.\n\nIn Desktop mode, I created a vehicle that rotates using mouse movement, but it also rotates while the ActionMenu is open. I would like to suppress this as well.\n\nBeyond these, there are many other situations where this capability could be useful.\n\nIf the open/close state of the ActionMenu could be retrieved, it would allow more creators to build systems that users can enjoy more comfortably.\n\nI would greatly appreciate your consideration of this request. Thank you very much in advance.",
